{{Quote|If we mine these approaches here and here, we can slow them down.|Captain [[Rex]]|<ref name="Zero">{{Rebels|Zero Hour}}</ref>}}
'''Mines''' were a type of explosive which exploded upon proximity to movement. There were many variants of mine, including [[land mine|land]] models<ref name="Life Debt">''[[Aftermath: Life Debt]]''</ref> such as [[ion mine]]s,<ref name="BTC">''[[Battlefront: Twilight Company]]''</ref> [[Realspace|space]] models such as [[gravity mine]]s,<ref name="Lando 2">[[Lando 2|''Lando'' 2]]</ref> and [[water|underwater]] models.<ref name="Bad">{{TBB|Bad Territory}}</ref>

